w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/30 bg-cyan-400/10 text-sm font-bold text-cyan-200\"> AI </span><span><span class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-200/70\">ASEAN Event Portal</span><span class=\"block text-lg font-semibold text-white\">ASEAN AI for Education Summit</span></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 text-sm text-slate-200 lg:flex\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"\">Beranda</a><a href=\"/about\" class=\"\">Tentang</a><a href=\"/speakers\" class=\"\">Pembicara</a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/program\" class=\"router-link-active router-link-exact-active\">Program</a><a href=\"/workshops\" class=\"\">Workshop</a><a href=\"/tickets\" class=\"\">Tiket</a><a href=\"/partners\" class=\"\">Mitra</a><a href=\"/faq\" class=\"\">FAQ</a><a href=\"/register\" class=\"\">Registrasi</a><a href=\"/dashboard\" class=\"\">Dashboard</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"#agenda\" class=\"hidden rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100 sm:inline-flex\"> Lihat Agenda </a><a href=\"/auth/login\" class=\"rounded-full bg-cyan-400 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950\"> Masuk </a></div></div></header><main><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><p class=\"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-200\">Detailed Event Program</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black\">Two days from inspiration to working prototypes.</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">18–19 November 2026 · Jakarta Convention Center · English</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><!--[--><button class=\"bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold\">Day 1</button><button class=\"border border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-white rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold\">Day 2</button><!--]--></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[.35fr_.65fr]\"><div class=\"glass-card h-fit rounded-[2rem] p-7\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-orange-200\">18 November 2026</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-bold\">Inspiration, Knowledge, and Collaboration</h2><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Understand the regional opportunity, learn from experts, identify education challenges, and form multidisciplinary teams.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><!--[--><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">07:30–09:00</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Arrival</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Registration and QR Code Check-In</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Identity verification, badge and welcome kit collection, workshop confirmation, and networking breakfast.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">09:00–09:30</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Opening</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Opening Ceremony</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">The state of AI in ASEAN, regional education challenges, social innovation, and long-term collaboration.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">09:30–10:30</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Keynote</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">The Future of AI in ASEAN Education</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Educational access, learning outcomes, teacher productivity, responsible implementation, and regional innovation.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">10:45–12:00</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Panel</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Building Responsible AI for Students and Teachers</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Student privacy, bias, human supervision, academic integrity, institutional readiness, and public trust.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">12:00–13:00</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Networking</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Networking Lunch</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Meet participants based on expertise, AI interests, workshop tracks, and collaboration goals.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">13:00–14:00</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Technical Session</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Designing AI Architecture for Education</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">LLMs, retrieval-augmented generation, vector databases, identity, APIs, monitoring, and security.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">14:00–14:45</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Technical Session</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Building Multilingual AI for ASEAN Learners</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Local datasets, prompt localization, speech, translation quality, cultural context, and validation.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">15:00–16:00</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Discovery</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Education Challenge Discovery</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Educators and institutions present real problems faced by students, teachers, and schools.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">16:00–18:00</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Collaboration</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">Team Formation, Ideation, and Mentor Review</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">Select a challenge, define users and impact, propose a solution, assign roles, and receive mentor feedback.</p></div></article><article class=\"glass-card grid gap-3 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:grid-cols-[140px_1fr]\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-cyan-200\">18:30–20:30</p><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-slate-500\">Community</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold\">ASEAN Developer Networking Night</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300\">An informal evening connecting developers, founders, educators, researchers, and partners.</p></div></article><!--]--></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative z-10 border-t border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8\"><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan-200\">ASEAN AI for Education</p><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400\">Building intelligent solutions for the future of education across Southeast Asia.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"\">Tentang</a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/program\" class=\"router-link-active router-link-exact-active\">Program</a><a href=\"/speakers\" class=\"\">Pembicara</a><a href=\"/workshops\" class=\"\">Workshop</a><a href=\"/partners\" class=\"\">Mitra</a><a href=\"/faq\" class=\"\">FAQ</a></div><div class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 md:text-right\"><p>Informasi: info@aseanaiedu.com</p>